        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "79fbef64-fea9-3e5e-8969-b0a7b19d1e69",
                "word": "скопом",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fd0c784f-3c9c-3b06-8c17-0565b0a3b8f5",
                        "entry_id": "79fbef64-fea9-3e5e-8969-b0a7b19d1e69",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. все вместе; сообща"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0a438f08-bdb9-4d9b-860c-09eacc4f0e7f",
                                "sense_id": "fd0c784f-3c9c-3b06-8c17-0565b0a3b8f5",
                                "text": "Пастушонок, с раздутой губой, в бараньей шапке, медленно гнал по ним стадо овец. Они двигались скопом, на ходу докармливаясь, с шумом дыхания."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "efd67d88-d7dc-4bef-917f-bf243d9ef32d",
                                "sense_id": "fd0c784f-3c9c-3b06-8c17-0565b0a3b8f5",
                                "text": "Они не гонят со сцены наглого актёра, осмелившегося любострастно взглянуть на их возлюбленную, а или спокойно отдают ему своё сокровище, или, быть может, и гадят, но только из-за угла, а потом скопом набрасываются на него и бьют."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3958d2f3-11e0-443b-a137-6b3ccf8d2ac0",
                        "source_entry_id": "79fbef64-fea9-3e5e-8969-b0a7b19d1e69",
                        "source_sense_id": "fd0c784f-3c9c-3b06-8c17-0565b0a3b8f5",
                        "target_lang_word": "together",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "together",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed939787-1096-3651-b6e6-2ec766f030ae",
                                        "entry_id": "cd962b91-08f7-3cfb-8b5a-36d5ae64d346",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "At the same time, in the same place; in close association or proximity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ab1589d3-7690-4e23-ab8b-67ee9fd2fd3e",
                                                "sense_id": "ed939787-1096-3651-b6e6-2ec766f030ae",
                                                "text": "We went to school together."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ddc4788d-3777-48b8-9b42-9f45d0af314d",
                                                "sense_id": "ed939787-1096-3651-b6e6-2ec766f030ae",
                                                "text": "We can't all talk together; let's take turns politely."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1a24e8f-bb24-4898-87f7-7169e4de42a4",
                                                "sense_id": "ed939787-1096-3651-b6e6-2ec766f030ae",
                                                "text": "[…]purſued his vnneighbourly purpoſe in ſuch ſort: that hee being the ſtronger perſwader, and ſhe (belike) too credulous in beleeuing or elſe ouer-feeble in reſiſting, from priuate imparlance, they fell to action; and continued their cloſe fight a long while together, vnſeene and vvithout ſuſpition, no doubt to their equall ioy and contentment."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7666a4ee-fd5d-4b34-93b2-0b3478ce9ee4",
                                                "sense_id": "ed939787-1096-3651-b6e6-2ec766f030ae",
                                                "text": "“[…] This is Mr. Churchill, who, as you are aware, is good enough to come to us for his diaconate, and, as we hope, for much longer; and being a gentleman of independent means, he declines to take any payment.” Saying this Walden rubbed his hands together and smiled contentedly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c9da1b39-286d-326e-8f58-14b97c834370",
                                        "entry_id": "cd962b91-08f7-3cfb-8b5a-36d5ae64d346",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Into one place; into a single thing; combined."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d8f8185-411e-4299-9ffe-651524d8104d",
                                                "sense_id": "c9da1b39-286d-326e-8f58-14b97c834370",
                                                "text": "He put all the parts together."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32080509-9571-49f2-bc11-a2d65535df41",
                                                "sense_id": "c9da1b39-286d-326e-8f58-14b97c834370",
                                                "text": "Ne take noon hede to brynge togidere þe parties of þe boon þat is to-broken or dislocate, til viij. daies ben goon in þe wyntir, & v. in þe somer; for þanne it schal make quytture, and be sikir from swellynge; & þanne brynge togidere þe brynkis eiþer þe disiuncture after þe techynge þat schal be seid in þe chapitle of algebra."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3c23c7b-3758-4b1c-8b88-a05e051232c4",
                                                "sense_id": "c9da1b39-286d-326e-8f58-14b97c834370",
                                                "text": "Sunning himself on the board steps, I saw for the first time Mr. Farquhar Fenelon Cooke. […] A silver snaffle on a heavy leather watch guard which connected the pockets of his corduroy waistcoat, together with a huge gold stirrup in his Ascot tie, sufficiently proclaimed his tastes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "35aa4cfb-c48e-37ef-a9cf-19b4a47c9187",
                                        "entry_id": "cd962b91-08f7-3cfb-8b5a-36d5ae64d346",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a relationship or partnership, for example a business relationship or a romantic partnership."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10a78ae0-e80c-4dce-bba4-a69c40188288",
                                                "sense_id": "35aa4cfb-c48e-37ef-a9cf-19b4a47c9187",
                                                "text": "Bob and Andy went into business together.  Jenny and Mark have been together since they went on holiday to Mexico."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58bb536e-15af-4a35-adb0-465ebb9adcf2",
                                                "sense_id": "35aa4cfb-c48e-37ef-a9cf-19b4a47c9187",
                                                "text": "A chap named Eleazir Kendrick and I had chummed in together the summer afore and built a fish-weir and shanty at Setuckit Point, down Orham way. For a spell we done pretty well."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f80b30e-c523-37fd-9308-922c1950bf09",
                                        "entry_id": "cd962b91-08f7-3cfb-8b5a-36d5ae64d346",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without intermission or interruption; continuously; uninterruptedly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59fbd4c5-b860-4a3b-b457-96944f31defa",
                                                "sense_id": "4f80b30e-c523-37fd-9308-922c1950bf09",
                                                "text": "It has been raining four days together"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f304dc4-c5fe-4856-aed2-b61b247c82f2",
                                                "sense_id": "4f80b30e-c523-37fd-9308-922c1950bf09",
                                                "text": "He would weep for hours together, and I verily believe that to the very end this spoilt child of life thought his weak tears in some way efficacious."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "together",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b1ce5039-6b6b-335c-acb2-89857095ef7c",
                                        "entry_id": "f5baff9f-30e6-376f-b420-572751100c33",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Coherent; well-organized."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ee0aed9-d216-4ec8-aec7-32263d496a37",
                                                "sense_id": "b1ce5039-6b6b-335c-acb2-89857095ef7c",
                                                "text": "He’s really together."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0be7db84-b1f9-4b51-bde4-29958ed19e67",
                                                "sense_id": "b1ce5039-6b6b-335c-acb2-89857095ef7c",
                                                "text": "Youthful, former fashion model & dancer needs to find a serious, together individual to call his own."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8585b01f-321f-438d-91ff-71a9c6113d5a",
                        "source_entry_id": "79fbef64-fea9-3e5e-8969-b0a7b19d1e69",
                        "source_sense_id": "fd0c784f-3c9c-3b06-8c17-0565b0a3b8f5",
                        "target_lang_word": "zusammen",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "zusammen",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bf7b1c7f-5cdf-3979-b52c-d9f1ec12dd3a",
                                        "entry_id": "736705e4-2e3e-3d3b-bf8d-cc5a180065b4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "gemeinschaftlich, miteinander; zum Beispiel etwas tun"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00dc938e-3457-4542-9294-60d22ae8f8e7",
                                                "sense_id": "bf7b1c7f-5cdf-3979-b52c-d9f1ec12dd3a",
                                                "text": "Die Nachbarskinder spielten zusammen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "282a7aa0-e1fa-4b82-9100-70316f80e375",
                                                "sense_id": "bf7b1c7f-5cdf-3979-b52c-d9f1ec12dd3a",
                                                "text": "Zusammen schaffen wir das!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "353c9f40-c184-42df-bc2a-0a6f2fc9c274",
                                                "sense_id": "bf7b1c7f-5cdf-3979-b52c-d9f1ec12dd3a",
                                                "text": "[Nobelpreis 2022:] „Der frühere US-Notenbankchef Ben Bernanke und die Ökonomen Douglas W. Diamond und Philip H. Dybvig werden zusammen \"für ihre Erforschung von Banken und Finanzkrisen\" ausgezeichnet.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e02e2e6-28dc-3132-87e1-a76cf6eb147f",
                                        "entry_id": "736705e4-2e3e-3d3b-bf8d-cc5a180065b4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "zur gleichen Zeit am gleichen Ort; zum Beispiel sich aufhalten"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60bddd05-01c6-41f7-bb00-c026b6857e6b",
                                                "sense_id": "7e02e2e6-28dc-3132-87e1-a76cf6eb147f",
                                                "text": "Um ein Uhr waren wir noch zusammen, danach hat sie den Zug nach München genommen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4798a184-ea8d-3817-801e-329fbcf7b03d",
                                        "entry_id": "736705e4-2e3e-3d3b-bf8d-cc5a180065b4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ein Liebespaar"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "in der Wendung „zusammen sein“ und ähnlichen",
                                            "untertreibend für"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90b0f8fe-9f4b-4eb9-bbd4-6e4fe11fa75d",
                                                "sense_id": "4798a184-ea8d-3817-801e-329fbcf7b03d",
                                                "text": "Im Urlaub kamen sie zufällig zusammen, seitdem sind sie zusammen, hoffentlich bleiben sie noch lange zusammen."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "857840d8-5e9f-3f4b-9949-e592c94f4a64",
                                        "entry_id": "736705e4-2e3e-3d3b-bf8d-cc5a180065b4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "als Summe betrachtet"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "163e2784-6f3c-49a9-b874-d896f5704a09",
                                                "sense_id": "857840d8-5e9f-3f4b-9949-e592c94f4a64",
                                                "text": "Die beiden sind zusammen 100 Jahre alt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "780ecb7e-ed66-45b4-a2a7-4ed43e82da3d",
                                                "sense_id": "857840d8-5e9f-3f4b-9949-e592c94f4a64",
                                                "text": "Wir beide hätten ja schon zusammen 100€, da bekommen wir sicher den Rest auch noch zusammen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f835dcc7-be4e-4dcb-a570-e22b677e617c",
                                                "sense_id": "857840d8-5e9f-3f4b-9949-e592c94f4a64",
                                                "text": "„Derzeit fällt jährlich allein tropischer Regenwald auf einer Fläche, die so groß ist, wie Bayern und Niedersachsen zusammen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"4\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2299f24f-122f-41c6-99fa-1961d17a0b31",
                        "source_entry_id": "79fbef64-fea9-3e5e-8969-b0a7b19d1e69",
                        "source_sense_id": "fd0c784f-3c9c-3b06-8c17-0565b0a3b8f5",
                        "target_lang_word": "gemeinsam",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gemeinsam",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab4b5e05-be85-3fda-ac62-36d095c74d83",
                                        "entry_id": "695bf3dc-7afc-3d14-9bdb-1b81eac0669a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "mehreren Personen oder Sachen zugleich eigen (jedem gehört ein Anteil daran)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8508054a-9f85-47f5-99aa-0cf1d91d97a5",
                                                "sense_id": "ab4b5e05-be85-3fda-ac62-36d095c74d83",
                                                "text": "Die beiden Länder verfolgen gemeinsame Interessen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e42b2e3f-d2fb-44d6-aae5-c2dfee963249",
                                                "sense_id": "ab4b5e05-be85-3fda-ac62-36d095c74d83",
                                                "text": "„So unterschiedlich das jeweilige Krisenmanagement auch ist - gemeinsam ist doch allen die Erkenntnis, dass es so jedenfalls keinesfalls weitergehen kann.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f01b183c-8325-4513-87e8-5b94d92722c9",
                                                "sense_id": "ab4b5e05-be85-3fda-ac62-36d095c74d83",
                                                "text": "„Nach der Heirat im August 1926 zog das ungleiche Paar nach Immenhausen bei Kassel, wo sie eine gemeinsame Hausarztpraxis eröffneten.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c328900-525e-3415-b967-ef35b2193d0b",
                                        "entry_id": "695bf3dc-7afc-3d14-9bdb-1b81eac0669a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "in Gemeinschaft, zusammen mit mindestens einem Anderen (neben- und miteinander)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "auch adverbiell"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb8a0c1c-2e66-4193-a56b-bb5e234aa398",
                                                "sense_id": "7c328900-525e-3415-b967-ef35b2193d0b",
                                                "text": "„Dabei basiert der Q6 auf dem neuen Q5 und damit auf der längsmodularen Plattform. […] Beide Modelle werden gemeinsam im neuen Audi-Werk in San José Chiapa (Mexiko) vom Band rollen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "677fab88-7ff9-4ffb-b65f-a464b1361784",
                                                "sense_id": "7c328900-525e-3415-b967-ef35b2193d0b",
                                                "text": "Das Buch entstand in gemeinsamer Arbeit der Autoren."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99727fdb-7b6c-4122-95a1-9070718684e3",
                                                "sense_id": "7c328900-525e-3415-b967-ef35b2193d0b",
                                                "text": "„Bald einmal gehörten die Deltaflieger so selbstverständlich zum Himmel über Vaduz wie die Bussarde und Milane, mit denen sie gemeinsam die Aufwinde nützen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "509eacbd-e27d-4257-ac1b-d2279860284f",
                                                "sense_id": "7c328900-525e-3415-b967-ef35b2193d0b",
                                                "text": "„Gemeinsam mit dem ehemaligen Deutschland-Chef von McKinsey Herbert Henzler und dem Extremkletterer Alexander Huber geht es am 10. und 11. Juli in die Bergregion Wilder Kaiser in Tirol.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "215b5809-ec11-4796-85fc-4973a051d1a7",
                                                "sense_id": "7c328900-525e-3415-b967-ef35b2193d0b",
                                                "text": "„Beim gemeinsamen Kreisen in der Thermik mit den ständigen Abstandsänderungen der Gleitschirme zueinander gilt in besonderem Maße Sehen und Gesehenwerden, […].“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
